\title{ethnoecology: Quantitative Ethnoecology Analysis and Landscape Knowledge Modeling}
\description{
The ethnoecology package provides tools for quantifying Traditional Ecological
Knowledge (LEK) in landscape and ecosystem contexts. It implements quantitative
ethnoecology indices (Landscape Use Value, Cultural Importance in Ecology,
Fidelity Level, etc.) and positions them within a larger framework of Bayesian
modeling and participatory land-use decision analysis.
}
